WEBVTT

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:50.320
They're so adorable...

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:58.830
The cockroaches on Earth.

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:05.330
I'm sure the people on Earth have no idea

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:11.590
that on Mars, it's the 
roaches that attack us.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:19.530
<i>That punch</i>

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.650
<i>wasn't aimed at Sheila...</i>

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:28.480
<i>Are they trying to destroy the rest of  
the medicine as quickly as possible</i>

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:31.440
<i>before we can transform?</i>

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:37.400
Everyone, hang on tight!

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:45.160
Bastard...

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:49.120
<i>They must have attached themselves 
to the vessel at that moment.</i>

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:52.700
<i>It's true that the radar wouldn't detect them
if they were right under us.</i>

00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:55.800
<i>But now, it's alone.</i>

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.480
Marcos and Keiji, I need 
just the two of you to

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:00.010
follow me and bring the medicine and nets.

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:01.010
Yes, sir.

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:01.670
Yes, sir.

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:05.240
The rest of you, 
hide inside the vessel.

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:18.490
We're going to

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:20.110
capture it here.

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:55.990
<b><i>All-Out War</i></b>

00:03:57.510 --> 00:04:01.290
To get a sample of the virus, 
we'll capture that thing right here.

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:07.990
We'll inject the medicine, 
and use our powers.

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:10.040
If I remember correctly,

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.710
the manual said that when 
there's only one of them...

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:15.190
Yeah. But there's way too much 
 we don't know about them,

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:17.900
so we should fight back 
with everything we've got.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:37.120
What?

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:38.800
It was a decoy?

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:52.690
They're trying to steal the escape vessel?!

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:23.110
No, no, the sight is over here.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:24.880
Hold it like this.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.610
Your M.A.R.S. Ranking is 89,

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:31.140
so you won't have to go 
toe to toe with the roaches,

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:34.030
but just learn how to use this.

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:35.650
That way, you can protect those precious

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:37.650
to you in case something happens.

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:41.180
Let's meet again on the surface!

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.110
Capturing!

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:51.030
<i>The net. It is something 
 that humans invented</i>

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:53.450
<i>and is one of their most strategic tools.</i>

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.500
<i>Alongside the evolution of humans,</i>

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.870
<i>the material nets are made 
from advanced from natural fibers</i>

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:01.880
<i>such as hemp, yarn, and cotton, 
to synthetic fibers that are much harder to cut.</i>

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:10.120
I'm not letting you get away!

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:11.340
Captain!

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:16.400
<i>This German Anti-Terraformar 
Net Launcher</i>

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:20.320
<i>is made to withstand three times 
a terraformar's strength.</i>

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:25.650
Capture complete.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:28.750
Well done, Sheila.

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:33.230
Your courage saved everyone here.

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:37.660
Thank you!

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:40.170
Marcos!

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:42.660
I'm gonna open up the vehicle's bug cage.

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:44.420
Help me throw this thing into it.

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:45.840
Right.

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:14.980
Actually...

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:20.530
U-NASA told me that if I found you, 
I should kill you, Honda-san.

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:24.500
Are they still holding a grudge?

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.160
About the fact we performed the

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:29.050
BUGS surgery twenty years 
ago without permission?

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:32.260
Well, that can't be helped.

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:36.990
Though I believe that we, the 
Japanese, thought "well done".

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:42.270
The scariest thing when it comes 
to one group against another

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:46.490
is having your techniques stolen.

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:50.390
<i>It wasn't fire.</i>

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:59.620
<i>The substance that pierced Sheila's chest</i>

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.530
<i>was an extremely hot gas.</i>

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:05.010
<i>Hydrogen peroxide and hydroquinone.</i>

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:07.860
<i>Th-The BUGS surgery...</i>

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:10.320
<i>How?!</i>

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:13.880
<i>Komachi Shokichi knew that power.</i>

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:16.970
<i>The bombardier beetle's gas spray.</i>

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:22.280
<i>The same power as one of the members 
of the Bugs 2 crew, twenty years ago.</i>

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:27.380
Sheila!

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:32.440
Sis...

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:36.550
There's no doubt about it. 
That thing's extremely fast movements

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:38.770
are something from 
the dead twenty years ago.

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:42.510
That is the power of the steninae 
water skater from the BUGS surgery.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.560
<i>The members of the Bugs 2 crew</i>

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:54.180
<i>were experimentally combined 
with various bugs</i>

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:58.830
<i>and made into hybrids to fight 
against the terraformars.</i>

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:03.020
<i>It was all so they could fight 
against the cockroaches on Mars.</i>

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:06.060
<i>To be equipped with weapons 
that could not be stolen...</i>

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:13.030
<i>But now...</i>

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.070
<i>They were stolen.</i>

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.340
Why are you holding me back?!

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:29.670
This is all because you—

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:41.720
I'm sorry. Holding off on the 
medicine was my mistake.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:50.170
Please lift your head, Captain.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:51.820
The enemy...

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:13.230
Sheila!

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:41.540
Don't speak.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.250
Your wound will just get worse.

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:46.340
Captain!

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.000
Please listen...

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:51.800
Sheila was...

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:54.000
Um, could you...

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:58.260
...teach me Japanese?

00:10:58.690 --> 00:11:00.040
Huh? Could it be

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:03.510
you're trying to get closer to the Captain?

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:07.890
How silly can you be?

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:10.020
Just teach her already.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:25.370
So you just want to be able 
to tell a Japanese guy

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:28.570
your true feelings and 
make an impact, right?

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:30.600
In that case, simple is best.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:35.530
Make sure you look straight into 
the Captain's eyes and say this...

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:03.280
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:05.450
<i>I understood, Sheila.</i>

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:08.780
<i>I'm so sorry.</i>

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:40.070
I'm sure that you

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:44.070
had the current crew undergo the 
same procedure, didn't you?

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:46.260
The procedure called the BUGS surgery.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:51.410
Yes... What was it actually called again?

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.310
The bugs...

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:56.310
The terraformar immunotolerance 
organ transplant surgery.

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:59.070
As well as being the generic 
term for bug hybrid surgery,

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:03.100
where we insert an insect's 
DNA array into human cells.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:04.630
Please stop messing around.

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:07.270
Oh, right.

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:13.440
However, the surgery that the members 
of the Annex 1 crew underwent

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:16.550
isn't actually called the BUGS surgery.

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:18.260
What?

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:24.930
That roach wasn't alone because 
it just happened to wander in.

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:30.620
Considering it possesses a power, 
it has a rank and a role to play.

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:37.620
Apparently their insight is far 
beyond what we had imagined.

00:13:41.030 --> 00:13:45.680
Apparently they figured out 
that we separated,

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:48.180
and where we're located.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:54.820
To think they've undergone 
the BUGS procedure...

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:59.350
<i>They stole it and made it their own...</i>

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:01.460
<i>The technology from Bugs 2...</i>

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:05.330
However, it just means that instead 
of dealing with one pest,

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:08.560
we get to deal with multiple 
kinds of them... huh?

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:11.300
That's fine, though.

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:14.660
They're relying on dated technology.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.160
Akari, the medicine.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.920
Ivan, we're going to use it.

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:22.920
The new surgery involving 
the BUGS procedure is called

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:26.860
Human Metamorphosis...

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:30.240
Mosaic Organ Operation.

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:41.350
You're vermin that live on this planet

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:44.020
that was nothing but a 
desert until recently...

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:47.550
We come from Earth, that burns

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:49.610
with the flame of the lives 
of 1,250,000 species.

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:51.750
Don't

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.020
mess with us.

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:08.540
Mosaic Organ...

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:12.440
You mean the immunotolerance 
organ the terraformars

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:15.560
have, which was used in the 
BUGS surgery twenty years ago?

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:18.260
That is correct.

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:23.930
The organ that allowed the 
terraformars to go through such a

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:25.610
drastic mutation in just 500 years.

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:31.200
They gained that through evolution, 
and we stole it from them.

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:33.350
The mosaic organ.

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:37.520
So the theory is the same 
as the BUGS surgery.

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:41.300
However, since it's not 
called that anymore...

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:42.910
That is correct.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:47.220
It is now possible with 
organisms other than bugs.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:55.110
We can use any species of 
organism on Earth as the base.

00:15:55.910 --> 00:15:59.960
We've also added the shell, 
open blood-vascular system,

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:02.210
and muscles of the treehopper.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.270
Which means

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:07.510
we left the strengths of 
the BUGS surgery intact,

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:10.260
while being able to combine 
the special abilities

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:13.810
of various Earth creatures 
of the land, sea, and air.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:17.130
But even twenty years ago,

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:20.800
the Asian giant hornet and bullet 
ant had a hard time on Mars.

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:25.130
When fighting against something that 
is the same height and weight as you,

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:28.050
what could possibly help the humans win?

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:32.340
Against those humanoid cockroaches?

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:03.700
<i>When the swiftness of the cockroach,
which we have all witnessed before,</i>

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.250
<i>is magnified to the size of a human,</i>

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:06.790
<i>it can be estimated that</i>

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:09.610
<i>they can travel 320 kilometers 
per hour from their first step.</i>

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:13.470
<i>This speed, out of all living things...</i>

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:19.500
<i>is supreme!</i>

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:20.260
<i>Nay!</i>

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:40.040
<i>While on the same scale,</i>

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:43.330
<i>there is an organism that runs 
and captures the cockroach.</i>

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:47.780
<i>That is the arthropod, 
the huntsman spider.</i>

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:50.110
<i>It doesn't use a web.</i>

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:55.030
<i>It uses its body hair, eight eyes, 
and the muscular fibers of its legs.</i>

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:24.290
So, you're Marcos and Alex.

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:28.790
Listen well. If you're going 
to live in our complex,

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:31.670
you are hereby forbidden to cause 
any trouble outside.

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:34.320
That is an order from your landlady!

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:38.460
Hey, who the hell's the bitchy girl?

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:40.130
Should we skin her?

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:42.180
She's not your little sister?

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.260
So she's just a piece of meat.

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:46.640
Hey, whoa! Stop! Stop!

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:07.750
You really thought you could 
win against all of us?

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:09.970
Come on. Hurry up and apologize.

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:14.750
Who the hell's this brat?

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:17.510
Are you going to take 
responsibility for them?

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:18.200
Yes, I am!

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:20.630
Hey! Don't just butt into 
our business, Sheila!

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:21.660
No!

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:24.760
Run away, you two!

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:29.050
It's the landlady's job 
to help her employees.

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:35.070
Why aren't you guys running away?!

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:37.300
You idiots!

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:40.450
Who cares? We won.

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:43.500
They just got tired of hitting you!

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:45.320
Look how hurt you are!

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.320
<i>Sheila...</i>

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:47.560
I thought you were going to die!

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:51.750
All right, Sheila.

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:57.110
We'll hold back on fighting 
with the other kids.

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:58.710
Not "hold back"!

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:01.800
We'll stop...

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:03.510
<i>Back then...</i>

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:07.590
<i>Thanks for saving us.</i>

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:06.280
Good!

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:28.320
Did you get in another fight?

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:33.960
Jeez... why don't you change it 
up and play baseball next time?

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:37.750
So...

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.820
Who won this time?

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:51.410
I'm going to...

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:54.480
...kill you all!

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:56.150
<b><i>Martian Atmosphere and Roach Suitability Ranking</i></b>

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:58.480
<b>9TH</b>

00:21:00.260 --> 00:21:03.030
<b>Marcos E. Garcia</b>

00:22:36.030 --> 00:22:38.840
Sheila sort of looked prettier than usual.

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:43.050
Well, c-considering how she usually 
looks... Just a little, yeah.

00:22:57.070 --> 00:22:59.150
Sh-Sheila.

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:01.700
Wh-What about the party?

00:23:01.700 --> 00:23:06.120
Private Sheila-chan has 
embarrassingly returned.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:08.420
Wow, that was fast.

00:23:08.420 --> 00:23:11.780
Well, there weren't any hot guys.

00:23:12.230 --> 00:23:15.390
More importantly, what were 
you two talking about?

00:23:15.390 --> 00:23:16.790
Huh? N-Nothing.

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:18.120
Was it about me?

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:19.460
Was it about me?

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:20.670
Hell no!

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:22.160
Then what?

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:24.250
What was it? Tell me!

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:25.480
It's nothing.

00:23:25.480 --> 00:23:28.390
What were you guys talking about?

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.020
<b><i>The Miracle Child</i></b>
